              <li><strong>Bring or run the app</strong><span>{' '}Proxy an app you already start, or let routeup run its configured command.</span></li>
              <li><strong>Expose explicitly</strong><span>{' '}Open the same targets through a hosted or self-hosted server only when needed.</span></li>
            </ul>

