            project. Use <code class="chip">routeup serve</code> for apps you already run, or bare{' '}
            <code class="chip">routeup</code> to start the configured command.
          </p>
          <div class="ru-mode-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Choose how routeup runs the app">
            {runModes.map((mode, index) => (
              <button
                type="button"
                class="ru-mode-tab"
                role="tab"
                id={`mode-tab-${mode.id}`}
                aria-controls={`mode-panel-${mode.id}`}
